","Guide the ball to the base by rotating the tower so each ring’s gap passes beneath the ball.":"Gida ezazu baloia oinarrira dorrea biratuz, eraztun bakoitzaren hutsunea baloiaren azpitik igarotzeko.","Rotate":"Biratu",", the round arrow buttons, drag sideways, or a gamepad stick. The ball never moves sideways — only the tower turns.":", gezi-botoi biribilak, arrastatu alboetara edo makilaren makil bat. Baloia ez da inoiz alboetara mugitzen; dorreak soilik biratzen du.","Danger sectors":"Sektore arriskutsuak","Striped arcs. Landing on one ends the run. They are striped as well as colored, so color is never the only signal.":"Marradun arkuak. Batean lurreratzeak korrika amaitzen du. Marradun eta koloretakoak dira, beraz, kolorea ez da inoiz seinale bakarra.","Combos & smashing":"Konbinazioak eta apurketa","Fall through 3+ rings without landing to charge the ball. A charged ball smashes straight through one danger sector. Centered drops earn precision bonuses.":"Erortu 3+ eraztunetatik lurreratu gabe baloia kargatzeko. Kargatutako baloi batek zuzenean apurtzen du arrisku-sektore bat. Zentratutako tantoek zehaztasun hobariak irabazten dituzte.","Other keys":"Beste gakoak","pause":"pausatu","undo (practice)":"desegin (praktikatu)","hint":"iradokizuna","confirm":"baieztatu","Audio":"Audioa","Captions for audio cues":"Audio-seinaleetarako azpitituluak","Accessibility & controls":"Irisgarritasuna eta kontrolak","Color-vision-safe palette":"Kolore-ikusmenaren paleta segurua","Left-handed controls":"Ezkerreko kontrolak","Hold-to-rotate buttons (vs toggle)":"Eutsi biratzeko botoiak (toggleen aurka)","Data":"Datuak","Replay tutorial":"Erreproduzitu tutoriala","Erase local data":"Ezabatu tokiko datuak","Erase all local Spiral Drop progress and settings?":"Spiral Drop tokiko aurrerapen eta ezarpen guztiak ezabatu?","Paused":"Pausatuta","Resume":"Curriculuma","Restart":"Berrabiarazi","Help":"Laguntza","Leave round":"Biribila utzi","Paused. Resume is the first option.":"Pausatuta. Curriculuma da lehen aukera.","Base Reached!":"Oinarria iritsi da!","Score breakdown":"Puntuazio banaketa","Total":"Guztira","Run":"Korrika","Layers descended":"Geruzak jaitsi dira","Best single drop":"Tanta bakarra onena","Smashes":"Apurketak","Time":"Denbora","Invalid actions":"Ekintza baliogabeak","Journey stars: {stars}":"Bidaiaren izarrak: {stars}","Next: {name}":"Hurrengoa: {name}","Retry":"Saiatu berriro","Replay this stage":"Erreproduzitu etapa hau","Watch replay":"Ikusi errepikapena","Menu":"Menua","Back":"Itzuli","Layer {n} / {total}":"Geruza {n} / {total}","SMASH":"SMASH","Layer {n} of {total}. Score {score}.":"{total}ren {n} geruza. Puntuazioa {score}.","Stage complete. Total score {n}.":"Etapa amaituta. Puntuazio osoa {n}.","Run over. Total score {n}.":"Korrika. Puntuazio osoa {n}.","Combo bonuses":"Hobari konbinatuak","Precision landings":"Zehaztasuneko lurreratzeak","Completion":"Amaitzea","Time bonus":"Denbora-bonua","Shattered on a danger sector":"Arrisku-sektore batean apurtuta","Out of rotation budget":"Errotaziotik kanpoko aurrekontua","Time expired":"Denbora amaitu da","Run abandoned":"Abandonatu da korrika","Run timed out":"Exekuzioaren denbora-muga gainditu da","Daily Drop — {date}":"Eguneko jaitsiera — {date}","Drop!":"Jaregin!","Go. {objective}":"Joan. {objective}","Daily Drop — reach the base.":"Eguneko jaitsiera — iritsi oinarrira.","Stage {n}: {name} — reach the base.":"Etapa {n}: {name} — oinarrira iritsi.","Reach the base.":"Oinarrira heldu.","Action not available":"Ekintza ez dago erabilgarri","Gap aligned — hold still!":"Hutsunea lerrokatuta — eutsi geldi!","Rotate left ({n}° to go)":"Biratu ezkerrera ({n}°)","Rotate right ({n}° to go)":"Biratu eskuinera ({n}° joateko)","Keep going.":"Jarraitu.","Replay — Esc to exit":"Erreproduzitu — Esc irteteko","Watching replay of the recorded run.":"Grabatutako lasterketaren erreprodukzioa ikusten.","Replay finished.":"Erreprodukzioa amaitu da.","Good! Rotation mastered — now reach the base, or