ira","Drift Shaft":"Drift Ardatza","Moving Target":"Helburu mugikorra","Double Drift":"Deriba bikoitza","Hazard Drift":"Arriskuen Deriva","Mastery Tide":"Maisutasun marea","Tight Squeeze":"Estu estua","Gauntlet":"Borroka-katea","Thin Ice":"Izotz mehea","Combo Weave":"Ehundura konbinatua","Pressure Drop":"Presio-jaitsiera","Long Fall":"Udazken luzea","Last Door":"Azken Atea","Mastery Crown":"Maisutasun koroa","Calm":"Lasai","Standard":"Estandarra","Expert":"Aditua","Minimal Touch":"Ukitu minimoa","Reach the base with a tight rotation budget.":"Iritsi oinarrira errotazio aurrekontu estu batekin.","Speedrun Spiral":"Espira Abikorra","Beat the clock to the base.":"Irabazi erlojua oinarrira.","Needlework":"Orratz lanak","Very narrow gaps. Precision is everything.":"Hutsune oso estuak. Zehaztasuna dena da.","Drift Storm":"Deriva Ekaitza","Every layer drifts. Read the motion.":"Geruza bakoitza noraezean doa. Irakurri mozioa.","The Long Drop":"Tanta Luzea","Forty layers. Endurance and nerve.":"Berrogei geruza. Erresistentzia eta nerbioa.","Breaker":"Haustura","Danger everywhere — chain drops to smash through.":"Arriskua nonahi: kate-tantak apurtzeko.","Rotate the Tower":"Dorrea biratu","The tower turns; the ball does not. Rotate left and right with ←/→, A/D, the on-screen arrows, or by dragging.":"Dorreak buelta ematen du; baloia ez. Biratu ezkerrera eta eskuinera ←/→, A/D, pantailako geziekin edo arrastatuz.","Find the Gap":"Aurkitu hutsunea","Line the glowing gap up with the ball and it drops through. Pass every layer to reach the base.":"Lerrokatu hutsune distiratsua baloiarekin eta jaisten da. Pasa geruza guztiak oinarrira iristeko.","Danger Sectors":"Arrisku-sektoreak","Striped sectors are dangerous. Never land on one — rotate past them before you drop.":"Marradun sektoreak arriskutsuak dira. Inoiz ez lurreratu batean - biratu haien ondoan erori baino lehen.","Combos":"Konbinazioak","Drop through several layers without landing for bonus points. Aligned gaps make a shaft — release and fall!":"Jaregin hainbat geruza zehar lurreratu gabe bonus puntuetarako. Lerrokaturiko hutsuneek ardatz bat egiten dute - askatu eta erori!","Smash Through":"Puskatu zehar","Pass 3 layers in one drop and the ball charges up — the next danger sector shatters instead of stopping you.":"Pasatu 3 geruza tanta batean eta baloia kargatu egingo da; hurrengo arrisku-sektorea apurtu egingo da zu gelditu beharrean.","Cancel":"Utzi","Erase":"Ezabatu","Key bindings":"Tekla-loturak","Open Options":"Ireki Aukerak","Progress erased.":"Aurrerapena ezabatu da.","Progress restored from your StarHermit cloud save.":"Aurrerapena leheneratu da zure StarHermit hodeiko gordetzetik.","Run over":"Korrika","Volumes, mute, graphics quality, language, larger text, high contrast and reduced motion are in the StarHermit Options.":"Bolumenak, mutua, grafikoen kalitatea, hizkuntza, testu handiagoa, kontraste handia eta mugimendu murriztua StarHermit Aukeretan daude."}
